    <string name="sample_title">Welcome to CueFlow</string>
    <string name="sample_content">Welcome to CueFlow.\n\nThis is your quiet, private teleprompter. Everything you write stays on this device — no account, no network, no distractions.\n\nTap play and the script scrolls at your pace. You can adjust speed and text size while you read. Tap the screen to bring the controls back.\n\nMirroring is built in for beam-splitter glass, and you can make it the default in Settings.\n\nWhen you are ready, delete this sample and write your own first line.\n\nGood luck. You have got this.</string>
